<title>USA: Envirodyne Q1 shr loss $0.18 vs loss $0.43.</title>
<headline>Envirodyne Q1 shr loss $0.18 vs loss $0.43.</headline>
<dateline>OAK BROOK, Ill 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997		     1996</p>
<p> Shr loss	  $0.18		    $0.43</p>
<p> Net loss	  2,600		    5,900</p>
<p> Sales	     154,500		  159,700</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  n/a			n/a</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Q1 1997 results included a $1.0 million gain from the sale of the oriented polystyrene business. The $1.0 million gain is included in other income and is not a component of earnings before interest, taxes, depreciation, and amortization (EBITDA).</p>
<p>EBITDA for Q1 March 27, 1997 was $22.7 million compared with $24.4 million for the three months ended March 28, 1996.</p>
<p>Full company name is Envirodyne Industries, Inc.</p>
